    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/3d41cc1c92309f98ef0709844ea2cf41.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/3d41cc1c92309f98ef0709844ea2cf41.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/3d41cc1c92309f98ef0709844ea2cf41.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go up? Get on the JanKenUP! elevator and check it out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270a Play rock, paper, and scissors while riding an elevator with no maximum floor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/db5c13d486db6aafb00879f19c90948c.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/db5c13d486db6aafb00879f19c90948c.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/db5c13d486db6aafb00879f19c90948c.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd90 Single player: unlock all characters, beat your records and get all the available achievements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/cf8d7869010e66e7aeb6891a370b5878.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/cf8d7869010e66e7aeb6891a370b5878.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/cf8d7869010e66e7aeb6891a370b5878.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270c Local multiplayer: Play with up to 8 players and settle who is the best once and for all (Joysticks required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/32e877195d8aa008918494551fa01f95.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/32e877195d8aa008918494551fa01f95.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/32e877195d8aa008918494551fa01f95.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/3d41cc1c92309f98ef0709844ea2cf41.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/3d41cc1c92309f98ef0709844ea2cf41.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/3d41cc1c92309f98ef0709844ea2cf41.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go up? Get on the JanKenUP! elevator and check it out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270a Play rock, paper, and scissors while riding an elevator with no maximum floor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/db5c13d486db6aafb00879f19c90948c.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/db5c13d486db6aafb00879f19c90948c.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/db5c13d486db6aafb00879f19c90948c.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd90 Single player: unlock all characters, beat your records and get all the available achievements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/cf8d7869010e66e7aeb6891a370b5878.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/cf8d7869010e66e7aeb6891a370b5878.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/cf8d7869010e66e7aeb6891a370b5878.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270c Local multiplayer: Play with up to 8 players and settle who is the best once and for all (Joysticks required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/32e877195d8aa008918494551fa01f95.poster.avif?t=1731702354\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/32e877195d8aa008918494551fa01f95.webm?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205560/extras/32e877195d8aa008918494551fa01f95.mp4?t=1731702354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
